---
layout: collection.njk
pagination:
  data: wingPages
  size: 1
  alias: wingPage
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ wingPage.permalink }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ wingPage.name }}"
  # `| safe` because this string is escaped again where it is used — in the meta
  # description and in the CollectionPage JSON-LD. Without it an apostrophe in
  # the intro ships as a literal &#39; on the page. The value is plain text from
  # wings.json, never markup.
  description: "{{ wingPage.intro | safe }}"
---
{#
  Wing landing page. One per live non-default wing (see src/_data/wingPages.js);
  the art wing's front door is the site homepage.

  DESIGN. This page is written in the site's own language, taken from
  src/index.html — the canonical statement of it — not in Tailwind's. The rules,
  and they are not optional:

    * Square corners. The homepage has zero border-radius declarations. So does
      .tag-pill on tags.html and .book-cover-tile in design-system.css. Radius on
      this site is Tailwind creep, not a decision.
    * No fills and no buttons. Things are separated by a 1px hairline
      (--color-border) or by whitespace. The one sanctioned button form is the
      hero CTA: 2px solid ink, square, uppercase Archivo Narrow, inverting on
      hover. Navigation is text.
    * Two typefaces with fixed jobs. Literata for titles and prose; Archivo
      Narrow, uppercase, tracked, in brown, for eyebrows, counts and labels.
    * Brown (--color-brown) is the accent for that small type. Not gray-500.

  Every list here is scoped with `inWing` — a landing page is a single-wing
  surface, so nothing on it may reach across the catalogue. Search stays global
  and is entered through the facet link below.

  The layout loads design-system.css, whose unlayered `* { margin: 0; padding: 0 }`
  reset beats every layered Tailwind utility — which is why the spacing here is
  declared in this block rather than borrowed from utility classes. Its `p` rule
  also caps prose at 65ch and centers it with auto margins; anywhere that reads as
  a stray indent, override all three properties (see .wing-featured-item p).
#}
<style>
    .wing-page {
        --color-ink: #0A0A0A;
        --color-brown: #8B7355;
        --color-border: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.12);

        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 2rem 6rem;
        font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif;
        color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    /* Masthead */
    .wing-masthead {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 70ch;
        margin: 0 auto 5rem;
    }

    .wing-eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .wing-title {
        font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .wing-intro {
        font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-weight: 300;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .wing-count {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* Text link, not a button. A hairline underline that darkens on hover is the
       site's link idiom (see .contact-item a on the homepage). */
    .wing-search {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        padding-bottom: 2px;
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .wing-search:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--color-brown); }

    /* Sections. A rule under the heading, not a box around the content. */
    .wing-section { margin-bottom: 4.5rem; }
    .wing-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .wing-section > h2 {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    /* Featured: hairline-separated rows, not cards. */
    .wing-featured { display: block; }

    .wing-featured-item {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 1.5rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    .wing-featured-item:first-child { padding-top: 0; }

    .wing-featured-thumb {
        width: 72px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.12);
    }

    .wing-featured-thumb img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
    }

    .wing-featured-item h3 {
        font-family: 'Literata', Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .wing-featured-item:hover h3 { color: var(--color-brown); }

    .wing-featured-item p {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-weight: 300;
        /* design-system.css caps every p at 65ch and centers it. */
        max-width: none;
        margin-left: 0;
        margin-right: 0;
    }

    .wing-featured-count {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
    }

    /* Recently added. Covers sit on the paper, held by their own shadow. */
    .wing-books {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem 1.75rem;
    }

    .wing-book { text-decoration: none; color: var(--color-ink); display: block; }

    .wing-book-cover {
        aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .wing-book-cover img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 12px rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.18));
        transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .wing-book:hover .wing-book-cover img { transform: translateY(-4px); }

    .wing-book-cover .no-cover {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .wing-book-author {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .wing-book-title {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .wing-book-meta {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.6);
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    /* Browse by subject: a list of names, set as text. */
    .wing-subjects {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem 2.5rem;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .wing-subjects a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--color-ink);
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .wing-subjects a:hover { color: var(--color-brown); }

    .wing-subjects .count {
        font-family: 'Archivo Narrow', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        color: var(--color-brown);
        margin-left: 0.4rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .wing-page { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
        .wing-masthead { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
        .wing-books { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
    }
</style>

<main>
    <div class="wing-page">

        <div class="wing-masthead">
            <div class="wing-eyebrow">Hudson Street Library</div>
            <h1 class="wing-title">{{ wingPage.name }}</h1>
            {% if wingPage.intro %}
                <p class="wing-intro">{{ wingPage.intro }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="wing-count">{{ wingPage.itemCount | commafy }} catalogued {% if wingPage.itemCount == 1 %}item{% else %}items{% endif %}</div>
            <div>
                <a href="/static-demo/?collection={{ wingPage.slug }}" class="wing-search">Search {{ wingPage.name }}</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        {% if wingPage.featured.length %}
        <section class="wing-section">
            <h2>Featured</h2>
            <div class="wing-featured">
                {% for c in wingPage.featured %}
                    <a href="{{ c.url }}" class="wing-featured-item">
                        {% if c.image %}
                            <div class="wing-featured-thumb">
                                <img src="{{ c.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div>
                            <h3>{{ c.title }}</h3>
                            {% if c.description %}<p>{{ c.description }}</p>{% endif %}
                            <span class="wing-featured-count">{{ c.count | commafy }} {% if c.count == 1 %}item{% else %}items{% endif %}</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {% set recent = books | inWing(wingPage.slug) | recentlyAdded(12) %}
        {% if recent.length %}
        <section class="wing-section">
            <h2>Recently Added</h2>
            <div class="wing-books">
                {% for book in recent %}
                    <a href="/books/{{ book.author_last | slugify }}_{{ book.title | slugify }}_{{ book.id }}/" class="wing-book">
                        <div class="wing-book-cover">
                            {% if book.image_url %}
                                <img src="{{ book.image_url }}" alt="{{ book.title }}" loading="lazy">
                            {% else %}
                                <span class="no-cover">No cover</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                        {% if book.author_full_name %}
                            <div class="wing-book-author">{{ book.author_full_name }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="wing-book-title">{{ book.title }}</div>
                        {% if book.publisher or book.publication_year %}
                            <div class="wing-book-meta">{% if book.publisher %}{{ book.publisher }}{% if book.publication_year %} &middot; {% endif %}{% endif %}{{ book.publication_year }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </a>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {% if wingPage.collections.length %}
        <section class="wing-section">
            <h2>Browse by Subject</h2>
            <ul class="wing-subjects">
                {% for c in wingPage.collections %}
                    <li>
                        <a href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.title }}<span class="count">{{ c.count | commafy }}</span></a>
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

    </div>
</main>
